<h1 data-copy-en="Gandon" data-copy-zh="Gandon">Gandon</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Quest-led progress, Wizardry lessons and the wizard initiation requirements." data-copy-zh="任务驱动进展、巫术课程与入会考试条件。">Quest-led progress, Wizardry lessons and the wizard initiation requirements.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Gandon</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Initiation_Answers_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Wizard_Initiation_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Wizardry_and_Master_Wizard_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Relationship_Progress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Gandon — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gandon.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Gandon — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gandon.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Gandon — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Gandon’s relationship is driven by his errands and magical services. Ordinary Talk mainly reports the current quest step and has 0 base relationship gain, so it is not a normal affection-grinding shortcut.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find Gandon</h2><p>Visit Medieval → Village Outskirts → Wizard Tower → Wizard’s Interior,10:00–20:00 daily. The shared tower also contains other characters and services; use Gandon’s portrait for his own lessons and quests.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Wizard's Interior</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Quest_Walkthrough"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Accept his first quest from Stranger. Follow the current Objectives for the requested items and return visits, then accept the revenge errand from Known(25). The acceptance actions take no time and each award 1 Wizards Guild Clout.</p><p>Wizard Initiation needs Gandon Acquaintance(50),Blinky Known(25),Wizards Guild Clout 50 and 60 minutes. A failure blocks another attempt that game day. The action is no longer needed once Lime is acquired; the Maid System guide gives the test’s practical requirements and rewards.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Brothel_Bar_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Wizardry requires Known(25) and Mystic 40:150 minutes,40 Energy and 40 Calm. Master Wizard requires Acquaintance(50) and Mystic 60:300 minutes,70 Energy and 70 Calm. Both are one-time skill lessons and disappear when learned.</p><p>The initiation pass threshold is 17 correct answers out of 25; a perfect 25 is a separate result. Do not confuse an initiation result with Gandon’s two ordinary skill lessons.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Gandon</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Wizard's Interior; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">3 safe uses/day; quest hints; base relationship gain 0</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Accept Quest</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Wizard's Interior; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day; Clout +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Accept Revenge Quest</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Wizard's Interior; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day; Clout +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Wizardry</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Wizard's Interior; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Mystic 40</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">150 min; −40 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Wizardry; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Master Wizard</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Wizard's Interior; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Mystic 60</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">300 min; −70 Energy; −70 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Master Wizard; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Wizard Initiation</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Wizard's Interior; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Blinky Known (25); Wizards Guild Clout 50; not already recruited Lime; no failed test today</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>If affection is not rising through Talk, progress his current errand. If a lesson is missing, check the skill’s Mystic requirement as well as Gandon’s relationship stage.</p><p>If the test is unavailable, check Blinky, guild Clout, whether you failed today and whether Lime is already acquired.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="character-sabbath.html">Sabbath</a> · <a href="character-blinky.html">Blinky</a> · <a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">Lime and the initiation</a> · <a href="skills.html">Skills</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Initiation_Answers_and_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Wizard_Initiation_Requirements"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Wizardry_and_Master_Wizard_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Relationship_Progress"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Gandon 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gandon.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Gandon 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/gandon.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Gandon 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Gandon主要通过委托和魔法服务推进关系。普通交谈用于报告当前任务步骤，基础关系奖励为0，不适合当作常规刷关系捷径。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>中世纪 → 村庄郊外 → 巫师塔 → 巫师塔内部，每天10:00—20:00。塔内还有其他角色与服务，Gandon自己的课程和任务在他的头像菜单中。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">巫师塔内部</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Quest_Walkthrough"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>陌生人时先接受第一项任务，按当前目标取得所需物品并回访；已知（25）后可接受后续报复委托。两种接受动作都不耗时，各增加巫师公会声望1。</p><p>巫师入门仪式需要Gandon相识（50）、Blinky已知（25）、巫师公会声望50与60分钟。当天考失败后不能立即重考；取得Lime后也不再需要此动作。考试的实用条件与奖励见女仆系统指南。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Brothel_Bar_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>巫术要求已知（25）与神秘40，耗150分钟、精力40、镇定40；魔法大师课程要求相识（50）与神秘60，耗300分钟、精力70、镇定70。两者都是一次性技能课程，已学会后隐藏。</p><p>巫师入门仪式25题答对17题即可通过，25题全对是另一种结果，不要与Gandon的两项普通技能课程混为一谈。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Gandon交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巫师塔内部; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">3次／日安全额度；任务提示；基础关系奖励0</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">接受任务</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巫师塔内部; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度；声望+1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">接受复仇任务</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巫师塔内部; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度；声望+1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习巫术</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巫师塔内部; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；神秘40</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">150分钟；−40 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会巫术；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习大巫师之道</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巫师塔内部; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；神秘60</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">300分钟；−70 精力；−70 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会魔法大师；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">巫师入门仪式</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">巫师塔内部; 10:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；Blinky 已知（25）；巫师公会声望50；尚未取得Lime，且当天尚未考试失败</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>交谈不涨关系时，推进当前委托。课程缺失时，除了关系阶段，还要检查技能本身的神秘要求。</p><p>考试不能开始时，检查Blinky、巫师公会声望、当天是否失败，以及是否已取得Lime。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="character-sabbath.html">Sabbath</a> · <a href="character-blinky.html">Blinky</a> · <a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">Lime与入会考试</a> · <a href="skills.html">技能</a></p></section>
